115","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117415#issuecomment-4060591115","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117415","id":4060591115,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7yB7QL","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-14T13:55:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-14T13:55:54Z","body":"I've reproduced this in:\n- v4.7.dev.custom_build [a59617870] (current `master`)\n- v4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\n- v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n- v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n\nSo doesn't look like a regression.\n\n> This is only a transient bug: restarting the editor will clear the yellow mark and allow edition/disconnection.\n\nAs often, restarting the editor is not needed, reloading the scene after saving is sufficient (in top menu: `Scene` -> `Reload Saved Scene`).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4060591115/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]